[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3815015211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115531#issuecomment-3815015211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115531","id":3815015211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jZIMr","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T02:16:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T02:16:52Z","body":"Having always on top is relevant for all floating windows, not just the script editor. So it seems odd to only have it here.\r\n\r\nOn Windows, you can use PowerToys to make any window always on top, see https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/powertoys/always-on-top\r\nAnd on Linux, I think there is already an always on top option.\r\n\r\nIt's possible to use an addon to do this without too much effort.\r\n\r\nI don't think this needs to be an Editor Setting either.\r\n\r\nIs there is a proposal for this?\r\n\r\nLinking previous version just for reference https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115140","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos